# Phase 3: Mountain Test v25

## Overview

Upgrade Mountain Test from v24 (measures leverage AFTER analysis) to v25 (Sleep Test + ROI as FIRST FILTER). Add Q6-ROI and Q7-PORTFOLIO questions. Restructure deterministic rules so capital-deployment models get priority over labor models.

## Requirements

- Functional: Q4-SLEEP becomes a FIRST-PASS filter — any model failing Q4 is immediately classified, not just penalized
- Functional: Add Q6-ROI: "ROI% = (monthly_passive / deploy_cost) * 100. Is ROI > 20%/mo?"
- Functional: Add Q7-PORTFOLIO: "Can this asset be part of a 3-5 asset portfolio with independent failure modes?"
- Functional: New verdict path: Q4=YES + Q6-ROI>20% + Q7=YES → DEPLOY_CANDIDATE (new verdict class)
- Non-functional: Existing v24 Q1-Q5 + Compounding + Asymmetry unchanged for TIER_2/3

## Architecture

Mountain Test v25 question sequence:

```
# Existing (unchanged for TIER_2/3)
Q1: Real founder URL proving >=10K/mo NET? (yes/no)
Q2: KG cohort confirms? (yes/no)
Q3-LINDY: Business model age >=50 years? (yes/no)
Q4-SLEEP: Revenue continues when founder does zero work for 30 days? (YES/NO/PARTIAL)
Q5-LEVERAGE: Primary leverage type (Naval hierarchy): CODE/MEDIA/CAPITAL/LABOR/HYBRID

# NEW for TIER_0/1 capital-deployment models
Q6-ROI: Monthly ROI% = (expected_monthly_passive / deploy_cost) * 100
    >40%/mo = EXCELLENT (micro-SaaS, digital products)
    20-40%/mo = GOOD (content assets, template catalogs)
    5-20%/mo = MODERATE (expired domains, ad arbitrage)
    <5%/mo = LOW (physical assets, inventory)
    0% = FAIL (labor model disguised as asset)

Q7-PORTFOLIO: Independent failure mode?
    YES: asset failure doesn't kill other assets in portfolio
    NO: correlated risk (all assets on same platform, same customer)

Compounding: (unchanged)
Asymmetry ratio: (unchanged)
```

New deterministic verdict rules (TIER_0/1 only):

```
# Capital-deployment verdicts (NEW — checked BEFORE labor verdicts)
Q4=YES + Q5!=LABOR + Q6-ROI>=20% + Q7=YES → DEPLOY_CANDIDATE
Q4=YES + Q5!=LABOR + Q6-ROI>=20% + Q7=NO → DEPLOY_CANDIDATE (with CONCENTRATION_WARNING)
Q4=YES + Q5!=LABOR + Q6-ROI<20% → SIDE_HUSTLE_WITH_STAIRCASE (low ROI but has asset)
Q4=PARTIAL + Q5!=LABOR + Q6-ROI>=20% → DEPLOY_CANDIDATE (with MAINTENANCE_WARNING)

# Existing labor verdicts (unchanged)
Q4=NO + Q5=LABOR → SIDE_HUSTLE (HARD CAP)
Q4=NO + Q5=HYBRID → SIDE_HUSTLE_WITH_STAIRCASE
```

Add DEPLOY_CANDIDATE to valid verdict classes everywhere:
- `stage0-quality-score.py` VALID_VERDICTS
- `persist-verdict.py` normalize_verdict_class() + EXEMPT_CLASSES
- `audit-schemas/stage0.json`

