## Risk Assessment

- **New verdict class breaks downstream:** persist-verdict + quality-score + audit-schema all get DEPLOY_CANDIDATE added. Case JSON output shape unchanged
- **ROI calculation gaming:** LLM could inflate ROI estimates. Mitigated by requiring calc-dispatcher P10/P50/P90 for ROI claims (existing infrastructure)
- **Q6/Q7 add complexity to already-complex Mountain Test:** Scoped to TIER_0/1 only. TIER_2/3 skip entirely
